{"text": "SUPERIOR COURT OF WASHINGTON FOR PIERCE COUNTY\n\nIMOGEN HAVERFORD, Petitioner,          No. 25-2-04418-6\n        v.\nCURTIS WREN MADDOX, Respondent.        DECLARATION OF PETITIONER IN SUPPORT\n                                           OF PETITION FOR PROTECTION ORDER\n                                           (chapter 7.105 RCW)\n\nI, Imogen Haverford, declare:\n\n1. I am the Petitioner. I was born 06/14/1991. Respondent Curtis Maddox (DOB 2/27/88) and I\n   lived together from 2019 until March 2023. We have one child, Posy, age 7, a second grader\n   at Larchmont Elementary. Our parenting plan is under 23-3-01187-2.\n\n2. My home address is confidential under GR 17. Mail goes to PO Box 4418, Tacoma, WA 98402.\n   I work as a vet tech at Saltgrass Veterinary Clinic, 6120 Pearl Street North, Tacoma.\n   Curtis lives at 1907 S. Yakima Ave., Apt. C, Tacoma 98405.\n\n3. On September 12, 2025 I found an Apple AirTag taped inside the rear bumper of my car, a gray Honda\n   Civic, plate BXK2284. The serial printed inside the battery cover is HGXT42LMP0QW. Officer\n   Brandon Stojanovic (badge #3317) took it under incident no. 2525501472.\n\n4. Between Sept. 14 and October 3, 2025 I got 43 emails from posys.real.dad@inbox.example, an account I\n   do not know. Several described what I wore that day. My lawyer's office pulled the headers: most came\n   from IP 203.0.113.58 and two from 2001:db8:4c2:11::7a. The same person runs the Instagram handle\n   @curt_maddox_253, which posted a photo of the clinic parking lot on 10/01/25.\n\n5. On October 3 Curtis waited by Posy's school in his black Toyota Tundra (WA plate C81 447K). The\n   office manager, Renee Winslow, walked Posy Haverford back inside and called 911. Ms. Winslow will\n   testify. Incident no. 25-276-0931.\n\n6. Curtis told me in August that he had stopped taking his lithium. He has a\n   2016 conviction for fourth-degree assault and he owns a Glock 19, serial BKRT918, which he kept in the truck.\n\n7. Since this started I have had panic attacks and my doctor put me on sertraline 50 mg. Posy has\n   started wetting the bed again. I changed my number to (253) 555-0126; the old one, 253.555.0190,\n   still gets his voicemails.\n\n8. He has also called the clinic line, 253-555-0103, hanging up when anyone but me answers, and on the 9th\n   he left a note on my windshield signed \"C.W.M.\" that said he \"knows the Spanaway place\" -- that is\n   my mother's house in Spanaway, where Posy and I have been sleeping.\n\n9. I ask for an order under RCW 7.105.100 restraining Mr. Maddox from contacting me or Posy, from coming\n   within 1,000 feet of my work, Posy's school or my mother's house, and requiring surrender of firearms. His\n   conduct is stalking as defined in RCW 9A.46.110.\n\nI declare under penalty of perjury under the laws of the State of Washington (RCW 9A.72.085) that the\nforegoing is true. Signed at Tacoma, Washington, on October 6, 2025.\n\n/s/ Imogen Haverford\n\nCounsel: Lakshmi Iyer, WSBA No. 51903, Iyer Family Law PLLC\nlakshmi@iyerfamilylaw.example  |  253-555-0158  |  file IFL-2025-0388", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "482 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Imogen Haverford", "Curtis Wren Maddox", "Posy", "Brandon Stojanovic", "Renee Winslow", "Mr. Maddox", "Lakshmi Iyer"], "companies": ["Apple", "Saltgrass Veterinary Clinic", "Spanaway"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Tacoma", "Pierce County", "Larchmont Elementary", "Saltgrass Veterinary Clinic", "PO Box 4418", "WA", "Yakima Ave", "Honda Civic", "BXK2284", "Toyota Tundra", "C81 447K", "Spanaway"], "health": ["panic attacks", "lithium", "sertraline", "wetting the bed"], "sensitive": ["stalking"], "names": ["Posy", "Imogen"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "labels": {}}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.10000000149011612, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 0, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ss